        <Font color="#000000" datum="TOP_LEFT" name="ＭＳ ゴシック" size="3.60" style="R"/>
        <String>21． FIX PART NO. LABEL WITH ID TAPE EXCEPT RED, YELLOW AND ORANGE. 
     COLOR VARIATION MUST CONFORM WITH VEHICLE FACTORY. </String>
