          <Fill color="#8080c0" type="NONE"/>
          <Font color="#000000" datum="TOP_LEFT" name="ＭＳ ゴシック" size="3.60" style="R"/>
          <String>(*1) FIX COT-B.
(*2) AFTER TAPING THE WIRING HARNESS BY A COUPLE OF TIMES,EXTEND THE TAPE 
     TO TAPE-BIND ONE SPLIT-END OF GROMMET 3 TO 4 TIMES.　
(*3) THEN BIND THE OTHER SPLIT-END 3 TO 4 TIMES AND CONTINUE TO EXTEND THE 
     TAPE DOWN ON THE WIRING HARNESS BY 50mm FROM THE END OF THE GROMMET.

DON'T TAPE PORTION Ａ .</String>
          <DatumPt x="30.92" y="758.24"/>
          <Size height="25.65" width="138.45"/>
        </TEXT>
